  "lowerNotes": {
    "value": "<b>Thunderfire Rocket Battery</b>: Uses artillery dice. Range 12\", number rolled is # hits scored. May not repel boarders. Misfire (d6): <b>1</b>: Roll dice again, <b>Battery</b> takes the hits, 2nd <b>misfire</b> barge explodes; <b>2</b>: Roll again, <b>Barge</b> takes that many its (opponent chooses high or low), <b>misfire</b> barge explodes; <b>3</b>: Barge takes d6 hits (opponent decides high or low); <b>4</b>: Place 1 damage on <b>Battery</b>; <b>5</b>: <b>Battery</b> does not fire this or next turn; <b>6</b>: Battery does not fire.",
    "scale": 0.55,
    "value_en": "<b>Thunderfire Rocket Battery</b>: Uses artillery dice. Range 12\", number rolled is # hits scored. May not repel boarders. Misfire (d6): <b>1</b>: Roll dice again, <b>Battery</b> takes the hits, 2nd <b>misfire</b> barge explodes; <b>2</b>: Roll again, <b>Barge</b> takes that many its (opponent chooses high or low), <b>misfire</b> barge explodes; <b>3</b>: Barge takes d6 hits (opponent decides high or low); <b>4</b>: Place 1 damage on <b>Battery</b>; <b>5</b>: <b>Battery</b> does not fire this or next turn; <b>6</b>: Battery does not fire.",
